tar.php?userid=1777811&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606746162" alt="weizhong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1777811)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weizhong" >weizhong</a></span>.<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-343">&quot;God&quot;</a> written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/far2" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=172904&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606746162" alt="far2" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=172904)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/far2" >far2</a></span>.<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4671">Clarky the Clown</a> written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/baronjoe" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3376201&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606746162" alt="Baronjoe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3376201)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/baronjoe" >Baronjoe</a></span>.</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h1><span>Extras</span></h1> <h2><span>SCP Play: Standing Together With BLM</span></h2> <div id="wiki-tabview-bdc6a27f0e821b251fc69c231d98b7ef" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Overview</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Audio File</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p><strong>Publish date: 06/08/2020</strong><br /> We took the week off to stand with the Black Lives Matter Movement. See the show details or our Twitter for all the content shared.</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <h1><span><a href="https://anchor.fm/scp-play/episodes/SCP-Play-Standing-Together-With-BLM-ef4nfb" target="_blank">Visit our Anchor page listen where you'd like!</a></span></h1> <p><iframe width="100%" height="100%" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" src="https://anchor.fm/scp-play/embed/episodes/SCP-Play-Standing-Together-With-BLM-ef4nfb"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> <h2><span>SCP Play: Sluggo's Protest</span></h2> <div id="wiki-tabview-9ac23564f1ec07a63acb538cfd8233cd" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Overview</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Audio File</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Credits/Links</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p><strong>Publish date: 10/12/2020</strong><br /> While our Keeper is on vacation, we've made a bonus episode! A heartfelt letter written from Sluggo to Manny, boss of the Circus of the Disquieting.</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <h1><span><a href="https://anchor.fm/scp-play/episodes/Sluggos-Protest-eku10h" target="_blank">Visit our Anchor page listen where you'd like!</a></span></h1> <p><iframe width="100%" height="100%" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" src="https://anchor.fm/scp-play/embed/episodes/Sluggos-Protest-eku10h"></iframe></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p><strong>SCPs referenced:</strong><br /> Original music produced by Hannah Mullen.<br /> Featuring voice of Sarah Winton as Foundation narrator.<br /> Sluggo art by <a href="https://www.instagram.com/beckerdraw/">beckerdraw on Instagram</a>.<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-amazing-sluggo">The Amazing Sluggo</a> written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crayne" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1346995&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606746162" alt="Crayne" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1346995)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crayne" >Crayne</a></span>.<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2094">SCP-2094 - Motormouth</a> written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1553042&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606746162" alt="PeppersGhost" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1553042)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" >PeppersGhost</a></span>.</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h1><span>Show Info, Socials, and Contact</span></h1> <div style="background: gray; padding: 1px 15px; border: solid 3px lightgray; margin: 10px; border-radius: 30px 15px;"> <div style="background: white; padding: 1px 15px; border: solid 3px lightgray; margin: 10px; border-radius: 30px 15px;"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>SCP: Secure, Contain, Play!<br /> SCP Play is a table top RPG running a Monster of the Week Campaign based off the SCP Universe. Join players Hannah, Jacob, Jordan, and Daniel on their perilous adventure as they try to survive in SCP Universe as interpreted by The Keeper, Kenneth!<br /> Episodes release at 6:30 am CST every other Monday!</p> <hr /> <h3><span>Listen:</span></h3> <p>Visit our podcast hosted at <a href="https://anchor.fm/scp-play" target="_blank">Anchor</a> or wherever we distribute!<br /> <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/scp-play/id1500783504">Apple Podcasts</a> - <a href="https://podcasts.google.com/?feed=aHR0cHM6Ly9hbmNob3IuZm0vcy8xMmRlZDJhMC9wb2RjYXN0L3Jzcw%3D%3D">Google Podcasts</a> - <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/6T8e6xQU31B0mERYbGc8DH">Spotify</a> - <a href="https://www.breaker.audio/scp-play">Breaker</a> - <a href="https://overcast.fm/itunes1500783504/scp-play">Overcast</a> - <a href="https://pca.st/zp5iqwyw">Pocket Casts</a> - <a href="https://radiopublic.com/scp-play-WdYOgp">RadioPublic</a></p> <h4><span>Follow:</span></h4> <p><a href="https://t.co/6o8Hfth0Xu?amp=1">Join Our Discord Server!</a><br /> <a href="https://www.patreon.com/scp_play">Patreon</a> - <a href="https://twitter.com/scp_play">Twit