&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; EMERGENCY?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why are people asking me if someone messed with SCP-5949? Actually, who turned it into a&amp;#8230; &amp;quot;WHICH WEED ARE YOU?&amp;quot; quiz??? The &lt;em&gt;Site Director&lt;/em&gt; is literally blowing up my phone about Clif Bars and I have absolutely no idea why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this is a joke or something, it&#039;s not funny. Did someone mess with SCP-5949? If anyone knows, please respond. Apparently, people are dropping like flies because they&#039;re somehow getting high from their devices?? Seriously, someone explain what&#039;s happening.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
