&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/int-translator&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4721888&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606746163&quot; alt=&quot;INT_Translator&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4721888)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/int-translator&quot;  &gt;INT_Translator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. A group of stars that, when seen from Earth, appear to have a special arrangement or alignment in geometric form that is easily remembered.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. In subsequent Celesta Events, however, it has been found that SCP-ES-105 &amp;quot;hides&amp;quot; the celestial bodies, rather than completely supplanting them.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. The fumes are non-anomalous instances of the St. Elmo&#039;s fire weather phenomenon.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. It is unknown what variables change the percentage of people affected.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Although all of these characteristics are inherent to Fifthism, neither the Foundation nor the UIU had recognized Fifthism as a Group of Interest at the time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Person was involved in several sensitive Fifth Church operations and similar groups, including SCP-ES-███. Missing since █/██/████.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. Civilian. She is not currently involved in any anomalous activities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. The heavenly body shown resembled a starfish.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. An employee of Funeral Home █████. Deceased.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. One of the Seven Gods of Fortune in Japanese Shintoism. According to Shintoism, it is the reincarnation of the Southern Polar Star.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. Parish of the █████ Church, in the outskirts of Buenos Aires. Missing person.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. Spanish weekly, specialized in news of events, which was published in Madrid between 1952 and 1987.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-328390-13&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;13&lt;/a&gt;. Currently, the five major religions being Christianity, Judaism, Islam, Buddhism, and Hinduism.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
