&lt;strong&gt;SCP-261 Powered or Unpowered&lt;/strong&gt;: Powered&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Item description&lt;/strong&gt;: Terri&#039;s &lt;em&gt;[sic]&lt;/em&gt; Chocolate Pumpkin &amp;#8212; A pumpkin-shaped piece of chocolate easily broken into 11 quarter-shaped pieces. Tasted vaguely of pumpkin and cough syrup. The Kraft Food Company does not make this product. Packaging in American English.&lt;/p&gt;
