				<title>SCP-3017</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3017</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-3017/unfortunate.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;unfortunate.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mugshot of Frasier Melbrook following a 20█4 arrest.&lt;/p&gt;
